<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Denmark's Jelved says EMU pact possible today.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Jelved says EMU pact possible today.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish Economy Minister Marianne Jelved said she believed it was possible a European Union summit could reach a deal on an EMU stability pact on Friday including figures for deficit limits.</p>
<p>Asked whether she expected a deal on that basis on Friday, she told Reuters: &quot;Yes. I think it is possible.&quot;</p>
<p>She said finance ministers had &quot;almost&quot; concluded the stability pact but there was &quot;still a little discussion about some figures&quot;.</p>
</text>
